        "TileImage": "$($repository b0273c48-d7a7-43c5-8d82-94cb7603c297).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. Your target today is one Yamato Narita, a doctor at the GAMA clinic in Hokkaido, Japan. The hospital services the global elite, providing experimental and often illegal surgeries for the right price. Nakita has threatened to expose GAMA, our client, for a number of illegal act unless he is paid a sum of five million dollars. Unfortunately for him, our prices are much more affordable. Good luck, 47.",
